#IMPVARSX-COFF: A COFF PROGRAM (CYGWIN) HAS NO TABLE OF THE COMPILER'S OWN VARIABLES FOR THE IMAGES: THE LINKER BOUNDS NO SECTION (ELF HAS __START_IMPVARS AND __STOP_IMPVARS, MACH-O GETSECTIONDATA), SO THERE IS NONE, AND IMPVARLIST FINDS NO TABLE (-1).  A COMPILER BUILT FOR IT SAVES NO IMAGE (/U AND /V).#

SUBR VSTART(Z) IS 0;

SUBR VSTOP(Z) IS 0;

SUBR WRITABLE(A,S) IS 0
%%
